# Round 85: WRITTEN-NAME discipline on every expression the SIMD family
# hoists. Three executed members of one family: O in IBOUND gave every
# lane the block-base column reduction length (triangular reduction,
# every odd column silently wrong, rc 0); D in SBASE made the round-84
# store-reach guard evaluate a STALE base and the vstore smash the heap
# (rc 134); a non-affine read base (d * (7 - d)) defeated the endpoint
# bound with 0/0 endpoints and interior max 12 (OOB heap read, rc 0).
# The loop's written names (O, D, ACC) may not appear in hoisted
# bounds or the store base, and read bases must be structurally AFFINE
# in D (is_affine_in); violations demote to the scalar path.
res is zeros of 8
src is zeros of 32
k is 0
loop while k < 32:
    src[k] is k + 1
    k is k + 1
o is 0
loop while o < 8:
    acc is 0
    d is 0
    loop while d < o + 1:
        acc is acc + src[d + o]
        d is d + 1
    res[o] is acc
    o is o + 1
p is 0
loop while p < 8:
    print of res[p]
    p is p + 1
